@HostAddress = http://localhost:5215

### Create Book
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Get All Books
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Books

### Get Book By ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Books/1

### Test Invalid Book
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Unknown"
}